# Private, never committed. Written before the first commit: a file committed once survives its
# own deletion.
#   _private/  the harvest and scoring pipeline, the raw ORCID records and per-profile scores.
#              They run on the maintainer's computer; only their aggregated output is published,
#              through scripts/export.mjs, which names every field it lets out.
#   _ref/      notes on how the private parts work.
#   CLAUDE.md  operational notes that describe the private pipeline.
_private/
_ref/
CLAUDE.md

# Copied from data/ at build time, so it can never go stale.
web/public/data/

# Build and dependencies
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Local tooling and OS noise
.claude/
.env
*.bundle
.DS_Store
